Qwen3.8-27B on TensorFold v0.6.3 (9356df5): opt-in FP8 (e4m3) attention cache for the dense CUDA engine.
TENSORFOLD_KV_DTYPE=fp8 stores keys and values as float8_e4m3fn (one byte, no scale, saturating), half of bf16. The rows a
forward attends to are rounded through e4m3 before use, so a key reads alike in a draft window and in the cache (drafted
replies still equal serial ones); the tree-attention kernels read FP8 caches directly, the prompt kernel is given the
cache's rows widened to bf16 for the layer. Unset, the engine is unchanged. Applies after 0001 and 0002.


